#. …戻って来たか。成果はどうだった？
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "So, you're back. How'd it go?"
msgstr ""

#. あの鍵で開いたのは…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I found out which room the key goes to."
msgstr ""

#. …４階の情報処理室。
#. あの部屋だったよ。
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's the data center, down on the 4th floor."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、情報処理室に入れるようになったんか！？
msgctxt "0004 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Then we can get into the data center now!?"
msgstr ""

#. なるほどな、そういう事だったか…
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Interesting..."
msgstr "Thú vị thật..."

#. だが、あの死体はなぜ、
#. 情報処理室の鍵なんかを持っていたんだ…？
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "But why did the now deceased have that key on them?"
msgstr ""

#. どうやら、情報処理室に行って、
#. 確かめてみる必要がありそうだな…
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I suppose we'll just have to go to the data center and\n"
"find out."
msgstr ""

#. うん…そうみたいだね…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, I think you're right..."
msgstr ""
